        <mxCell id="desc_text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="This system context diagram depicts the dual integration paths for the Kazakh-Russian NLP system. Regular end-users interact with the system directly through the native Web Interface, which communicates with the core backend. Simultaneously, third-party developers utilize external applications to consume the exposed REST API directly. Both entry points send text inputs and receive structured JSON responses containing language identification, code-switching detection, and sentiment analysis metrics." vertex="1">
